# CODEOWNERS — who must review what.
#
# GitHub requests a review from the owner of every path a PR touches, and (once the
# "require review from Code Owners" branch rule is on) blocks merge until they approve.
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ⚠️ PLACEHOLDER TEAMS — these teams DO NOT EXIST YET.
#
# GitHub SILENTLY IGNORES an owner that is not a team/user with write access to the
# repo, so until the three teams below are created in the Oppex-AI org and given
# write access, these rules enforce NOTHING. See GOVERNANCE.md § Teams and roles.
#
#   @Oppex-AI/oak-maintainers  merge + repo maintenance
#   @Oppex-AI/oak-reviewers    general code review
#   @Oppex-AI/oak-security     security-sensitive execution / auth / permission review
#
# Interim, until those teams exist: replace them with an existing team that has write
# access (e.g. @Oppex-AI/oppex-engineering) or with named maintainers, so review is
# actually required.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Default owner for everything not matched more specifically below.
*                                       @Oppex-AI/oak-maintainers

# Governance, CI and this file itself — maintainers only.
# (Listing CODEOWNERS here is what protects CODEOWNERS from being edited unreviewed.)
/.github/                               @Oppex-AI/oak-maintainers
